WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:07.864
Threat hunting proactively searches for evidence of suspicious or malicious activity that may evade automated detection.

00:00:07.864 --> 00:00:11.746
Hunting complements monitoring by using hypotheses, telemetry, intelligence,

00:00:11.746 --> 00:00:14.657
and analyst judgment to explore uncertainty.

00:00:14.657 --> 00:00:19.025
Valuable outcomes include improved visibility, stronger detections, better baselines,

00:00:19.025 --> 00:00:22.421
identified coverage gaps, and informed incident handoffs.

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:27.274
Mature programs combine governance, skilled analysts, quality data, repeatable methods,

00:00:27.274 --> 00:00:29.700
collaboration, measurement, and continuous learning.
